seemingly unable to support herself. Frank's wife Mavis was just getting out of bed when she heard Marion's distraught cries. Frank began to call out Mavis' name, asking for her help. Mavis quickly pulled on a dressing gown and ran outside to investigate. She only knew Marion to say hello to in the street, but now the young mother was a sobbing wreck in Frank's arms. It's her little girl, Frank said. Without hesitating, Mavis ran towards Marion's home. The front door was wide open.

5
00:03:28.000 --> 00:04:02.000
