00:23:40.000 --> 00:24:07.000
In a 2006 interview with the Sunday age, Marianne said, I thought, no, as soon as you do that, that bastard's going to turn around and say guilt got her, and he was not going to do that to Bonnie. They would have shut the book. and I wasn't going to let them do that. She was worth more than that. During the first couple of years after Bonnie's death,

